\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7907\'3fng b\u7855\'3ft bu\u7897\'3fc n\'f3i t\u7841\'3f}{\f70\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 i \'f0i}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7875\'3fm 1 m\u7909\'3f}{\f78\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 c I Th
\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par }{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 b. Kho\u7843\'3fn thu BHYT x\'e3, ph}{\f78\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7901\'3fng tr\'edch n\u7897\'3fp l\'ean 80%.
\par C\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thu thu\u7897\'3f}{\f70\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 c \'f0i}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7875\'3f}{\f78\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 m 2 (a, b) tr\'ean \'f0\'fd}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7907\'3fc s
\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3f}{\f78\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 ng nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 - 2% n\u7897\'3fp BHYT Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam.
\par - 90% chi cho kh\'e1m, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh.
\par - 8% chi qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd HCSN b\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f.
\par c. Kho\u7843\'3fn thu \u7903\'3f}{\f70\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867  \'f0i}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 \u7875\'3fm 3 m\u7909\'3f}{\f78\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 c I Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\'fd}{\f0\insrsid14566910\charrsid14574867 
